---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-[#e5c158]/20 mt-24 py-12 text-xs font-mono text-[#c5cbd3] bg-[#220204]/80 backdrop-blur-md transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-[1720px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-[#e5c158]/15">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-serif text-base font-normal text-[#e5c158]">Ozan Özdil</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#c5cbd3] max-w-md">
          Yapay zekâ destekli kodlama, açık kaynak sistem mimarileri ve dijital egemenlik.
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs font-mono" aria-label="Footer Nav">
        <a href="/" class="text-[#c5cbd3] hover:text-[#e5c158] transition-colors">Ana Sayfa</a>
        <a href="/hakkimda" class="text-[#c5cbd3] hover:text-[#e5c158] transition-colors">Hakkımda</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="text-[#c5cbd3] hover:text-[#e5c158] transition-colors">Yazılar</a>
        <a href="/projeler" class="text-[#c5cbd3] hover:text-[#e5c158] transition-colors">Projeler</a>
        <a href="/galeri" class="text-[#c5cbd3] hover:text-[#e5c158] transition-colors">Galeri</a>
        <a href="/llms.txt" target="_blank" class="text-[#e5c158] hover:text-[#f3e5ab] transition-colors flex items-center gap-0.5">llms.txt ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[#8c7e74]">
        <span>Kastamonu, TR</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>© {currentYear} Ozan Özdil</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/ozdil" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-[#e5c158] bg-[#e5c158]/10 hover:bg-[#e5c158]/20 border border-[#e5c158]/30 transition-colors">
          kahve ısmarla ↗
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/ozdil/ozanozdil.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#2d0306] text-[#c5cbd3] hover:text-[#e5c158] border border-[#e5c158]/20 hover:border-[#e5c158]/40 transition-colors">
          repo ↗
        </a>
        <a href="/rss.xml" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#2d0306] text-[#c5cbd3] hover:text-[#e5c158] border border-[#e5c158]/20 hover:border-[#e5c158]/40 transition-colors">
          rss ↗
        </a>
        <a href="#top" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#2d0306] text-[#c5cbd3] hover:text-[#e5c158] border border-[#e5c158]/20 hover:border-[#e5c158]/40 transition-colors">
          başa dön ↑
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
